{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54586","headline":"兵要望江南 占霞第六（京本列第二十六○十一首） 六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占霞第六（京本列第二十六○十一首） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"商音姓，前怕赤霞拦。\n徴姓黑霞幷黑气，皆爲鬼贼怕相残（京本作「攀」），不得视爲闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}